  "body": "I just noticed that the package doesn't include any of the docs!\r\n\r\nTypically, if the docs are removed when packaging something for debian, a separate doc package is created, unfortunately in this case that hasn't happened.\r\n\r\nThere is a very rough getting started in the package description that would probably be better in a doc in /usr/share/docs/matrix-synapse along with the original README.rst etc",
